Smart Shield is evolving from Argo Smart Routing; practices remain applicable. Monitor Cloudflare changelog for updates.

Best practices:
- Always check editability before attempting to enable/disable Argo.
- Set up billing notifications; combine with Tiered Cache.
- Use in production only; disable for dev/staging to control costs.
- Detailed metrics require 500+ requests in 48h. Monitor analytics.
- Handle billing, permissions, and zone-compatibility errors gracefully.
- Test configuration changes in staging before production.
- Use TypeScript SDK; implement production API retry logic.
- Document zone-specific settings.

Troubleshooting:
- “Argo Smart Routing is unavailable for this zone”: requires Enterprise+ eligibility and configured billing/payment; contact Cloudflare support if unclear.
- Unchanged status or `editable: false`: check `Zone:Argo Smart Routing:Edit` permission, billing, Enterprise+ plan, and zone holds/suspensions. Verify `editable: true` before PATCH.
- If `editable: false`, do not attempt to modify.

```ts
const status = await client.argo.smartRouting.get({ zone_id: zoneId });
if (!status.editable) {
  console.error("Cannot modify Argo settings:");
  console.error("- Check billing is configured");
  console.error("- Verify zone has Enterprise+ plan");
  console.error("- Confirm API token has Edit permission");
  throw new Error("Argo is not editable for this zone");
  // Safe to proceed with enable/disable
  await client.argo.smartRouting.edit({ zone_id: zoneId, value: "on" });
}
```

429 rate limit: typically 1200 requests per 5 minutes per API token across endpoints. Use retry-after/exponential backoff:
```ts
import { RateLimitError } from "cloudflare";
await client.argo.smartRouting.edit({ zone_id: zoneId, value: "on" });
if (error instanceof RateLimitError) {
  const retryAfter = error.response?.headers.get("retry-after");
  console.log(`Rate limited. Retry after ${retryAfter} seconds`);
  // Implement exponential backoff
  await new Promise((resolve) =>
    setTimeout(resolve, (retryAfter || 60) * 1000)
```

Limits/notes: Proxied (orange-clouded) DNS traffic counts; DDoS/WAF-mitigated traffic excluded from billing. Spectrum has no hard app limit; each app can enable Argo independently. Analytics latency 1–5 minutes; real-time metrics unavailable.

Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/argo-smart-routing/ ; https://developers.cloudflare.com/smart-shield/ ; https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/api/get-started/create-token/ ; https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-typescript ; https://github.com/cloudflare/cloudflare-python/
